MetroFlow 1.0.0 — original MetroFuse UI plugin.
Extracted from https://github.com/956tris/MetroFuse
Original paths: plugins/javascript/metroflow, plugins/metroflow-native,
scripts/test_metroflow.mjs and tooling/pack-mfp.ps1.
The MetroFuse application is based on Metrolist. Original source attribution
and GPL-3.0 license are retained in LICENSE and each plugin's SOURCE file.
